cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or build on Kuluri, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "Kuluri: record once, share with control"
abstract: >-
  Prototype app that connects farms and seasonal workers through agreements and
  work records the workers confirm themselves. Confirmed records are fingerprinted
  and can answer buyers' and public administrations' requests with totals only.
  Built at the EU Agri-Hackathon 2026 (DG AGRI), Challenge 3, on the organisers'
  synthetic dataset.
